From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brian Jenkins <brianjenkins94@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:30:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: split extension host contribution per feature

extensionHost.contribution still imports everything, but the chat, notebook
and mcp mainThread participants now live in their own files next to an
extensionHost.base.contribution, so they can be loaded only when needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
